+"""Native voice seam: configured Mistral STT and TTS through the stock pipeline and the REAL pinned ``mistralai`` SDK.
+
+``mistralai==2.4.8`` (and its newly staged pure-Python dependencies) are the lock-pinned wheels of the owned offline
+overlay: hash-verified, extracted inert, never installed, imported under the unchanged guard. Only the network bytes
+are synthetic (the httpx transport), so the SDK's own request builder, retry/redirect/timeout handling and response
+parser run for every case here. Stand-ins for misbehaving SDKs live in ``test_native_voice_mistral_accounting``.
+"""
